# Yasharn, Implacable Earth's "Players can't ... sacrifice nonland permanents to ... activate abilities" (CR 101.2, 602.2b)
# reaches a cost that sacrifices the permanent that granted the ability (CR 201.5a): Bot2's Yasharn stops Bot1's
# Ornithopter, equipped with Deconstruction Hammer, activating "{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Deconstruction Hammer" at Bot2's Sol
# Ring, though the mana is there. Bot1 then exiles Yasharn with Swords to Plowshares, and the same ability is activated
# with the same mana (the positive control): the Hammer is sacrificed and the Sol Ring destroyed.

